B.bpD=A.a(s(["\ud83d\udd34 Status refractario (>40 min o fallo a 2\xaa l\xednea): anestesia general con IOT \u2014 midazolam/propofol; EEG continuo obligatorio","\ud83d\udd34 Status s\xfaper-refractario (>24 h en anestesia): considerar ketamina, dieta cetog\xe9nica, corticoide","\ud83d\udfe0 Status establecido (20\u201340 min, fall\xf3 BZD): 2\xaa l\xednea \u2014 fenito\xedna 20 mg/kg IV O levetiracetam 60 mg/kg IV O valproato 40 mg/kg IV","\ud83d\udfe1 Status inicial (5\u201320 min): 1\xaa l\xednea \u2014 benzodiazepina (midazolam IM O diazepam IV O clonazepam IV)"]),t.s)
